WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:02.787
A team wanted an agent to route tickets,

2
00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:04.287
and three months in,

3
00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:07.767
it was a fragile loop doing one prompt's job.

4
00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.067
The question is who drives the loop,

5
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:13.047
since an AI agent picks its next step,

6
00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:15.667
and an AI assistant leaves it to you.

7
00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.727
Each pass is a model call,

8
00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:22.307
and the loop can fail in ways that are hard to predict.

9
00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:27.953
So I'd want an agent when each step depends on what the last one found,

10
00:00:27.953 --> 00:00:29.913
like tracing a checkout bug.

11
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:34.833
To check, I ask if a human could do it in under five minutes with the right tools,

12
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:35.813
and if so,

13
00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:37.253
I'd build an assistant.
